---
---

<section class="w-full py-16 lg:py-28 bg-surfaceLight font-gothic" aria-label="Programa del curso">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="mb-10 lg:mb-16 opacity-0" data-animate>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl uppercase text-primary text-center">Programa del curso</h2>
      <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-accent rounded-full mx-auto mt-4"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4 opacity-0" data-animate style="animation-delay: 100ms">
      <details class="group bg-white border border-accentMuted rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent/50">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer p-6 lg:p-8 flex items-center justify-between select-none">
          <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-primary pr-4">Módulo 1 — Introducción al oficio</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary/60 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 lg:px-8 pt-2 pb-6 lg:pt-2 lg:pb-8">
          <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-primary/80 leading-relaxed">Historia de la barbería, conocimiento de herramientas, kit básico, asesoramiento, vestimenta adecuada, higiene y esterilización. También se trabaja la observación paso a paso de cómo se recibe al cliente y cómo se realiza un corte.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-white border border-accentMuted rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent/50">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer p-6 lg:p-8 flex items-center justify-between select-none">
          <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-primary pr-4">Módulo 2 — Herramientas y corte clásico</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary/60 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 lg:px-8 pt-2 pb-6 lg:pt-2 lg:pb-8">
          <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-primary/80 leading-relaxed">Preparación de la mesa de trabajo, uso correcto de máquinas, tijera y navaja. Introducción al corte clásico y al corte con peine y tijera.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-white border border-accentMuted rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent/50">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer p-6 lg:p-8 flex items-center justify-between select-none">
          <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-primary pr-4">Módulo 3 — Corte moderno y navaja</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary/60 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 lg:px-8 pt-2 pb-6 lg:pt-2 lg:pb-8">
          <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-primary/80 leading-relaxed">Degradé de 1 a 3, corte moderno, corte con navaja y diferencias entre corte moderno y corte clásico.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-white border border-accentMuted rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent/50">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer p-6 lg:p-8 flex items-center justify-between select-none">
          <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-primary pr-4">Módulo 4 — Degradés y práctica</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary/60 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 lg:px-8 pt-2 pb-6 lg:pt-2 lg:pb-8">
          <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-primary/80 leading-relaxed">Degradé bajo, medio y alto. Prácticas guiadas, diferencias entre cortes, autocorrección, repaso y resolución de dudas.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-white border border-accentMuted rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent/50">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer p-6 lg:p-8 flex items-center justify-between select-none">
          <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-primary pr-4">Módulo 5 — Barba y perfilado</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary/60 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 lg:px-8 pt-2 pb-6 lg:pt-2 lg:pb-8">
          <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-primary/80 leading-relaxed">Trabajo de barba, perfilado, degradé en barba y perfilado de cejas.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-white border border-accentMuted rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent/50">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer p-6 lg:p-8 flex items-center justify-between select-none">
          <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-primary pr-4">Módulo 6 — Diseños</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary/60 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 lg:px-8 pt-2 pb-6 lg:pt-2 lg:pb-8">
          <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-primary/80 leading-relaxed">Diseños con línea recta, curva y circular. Demostración de diseños avanzados y ejercicios de aplicación.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-white border border-accentMuted rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent/50">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer p-6 lg:p-8 flex items-center justify-between select-none">
          <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-primary pr-4">Módulo 7 — Permanente y colorimetría básica</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary/60 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 lg:px-8 pt-2 pb-6 lg:pt-2 lg:pb-8">
          <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-primary/80 leading-relaxed">Introducción a permanente y colorimetría básica.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-white border border-accentMuted rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent/50">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer p-6 lg:p-8 flex items-center justify-between select-none">
          <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-primary pr-4">Examen final</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary/60 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 lg:px-8 pt-2 pb-6 lg:pt-2 lg:pb-8">
          <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-primary/80 leading-relaxed">Evaluación final para acceder al certificado.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
